<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="info-page">
    <section class="info-hero">
        <span class="info-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question"></i></span>
        <p class="info-eyebrow">Answers at a glance</p>
        <h1>Questions &amp; answers</h1>
        <p>Common questions about using WonderLust as a guest or host.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card faq-list">
        <details open>
            <summary>How do I search for a destination?</summary>
            <p>Enter a location in the search bar and select Search. You can also use categories and the filters button to refine the results.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>How do I create a listing?</summary>
            <p>Sign in, choose Airbnb your home from the navigation, complete the form, select a category, and upload a listing image.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Where can I see my bookings?</summary>
            <p>Open your Profile while signed in. Your reservations appear in the bookings section with their current status.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>Can I cancel a booking?</summary>
            <p>Open the booking confirmation or your profile, then use the cancellation option when it is available for that reservation.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>How do I save a listing?</summary>
            <p>Select the heart icon on a listing card or listing detail page. Saved listings are available under My Wishlist.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>How do I change the theme?</summary>
            <p>Use the moon or sun icon in the navigation bar to switch between light and dark mode. Your preference is remembered on this device.</p>
        </details>
    </section>
</main>
